{"steam_appid":2638250,"steam_name":"Apex Rush","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2638250/211342637/2dfbd4554770c01cc893c9dd25e47d8850767e87/1770491960/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770493111","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257281996/05988ec369f15dc97b01583d544e58a9f873e739/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770493111","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638250/f2906abc51401d4fd12512e322d888688059a190/ss_f2906abc51401d4fd12512e322d888688059a190.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783430997","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638250/d3cd43bb2f775d706840f06caf90170ca31b366e/ss_d3cd43bb2f775d706840f06caf90170ca31b366e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783430997","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638250/825f2c5d2c9c0bf941d367ef823cd9d5d3de338e/ss_825f2c5d2c9c0bf941d367ef823cd9d5d3de338e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783430997","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638250/21ebfcfefd9d555ff5366dff54e1d182b1a1352c/ss_21ebfcfefd9d555ff5366dff54e1d182b1a1352c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783430997","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638250/7f3ecdf1c66a0b70fff19ac0ae666b562ea23c6b/ss_7f3ecdf1c66a0b70fff19ac0ae666b562ea23c6b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783430997"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RACE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the time on 54 exciting stunt tracks and additional 10 training tracks, set your fastest time and battle other players on the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638250/extras/8746e4bf090e91bb68c579c88fd7cbe5.poster.avif?t=1783430997\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638250/extras/8746e4bf090e91bb68c579c88fd7cbe5.webm?t=1783430997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638250/extras/8746e4bf090e91bb68c579c88fd7cbe5.mp4?t=1783430997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GHOST FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against your personal best ghost or any leaderboard entry &amp; watch replays of other players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638250/extras/97e637cd4363f60f73ff33c294c0ede5.poster.avif?t=1783430997\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638250/extras/97e637cd4363f60f73ff33c294c0ede5.webm?t=1783430997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638250/extras/97e637cd4363f60f73ff33c294c0ede5.mp4?t=1783430997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DRIFT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth drifting with 20 various challenges across 3 different world maps including time attack, rush &amp; freestyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638250/extras/21a710b89b0a0635fa2b6386b3833082.poster.avif?t=1783430997\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638250/extras/21a710b89b0a0635fa2b6386b3833082.webm?t=1783430997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638250/extras/21a710b89b0a0635fa2b6386b3833082.mp4?t=1783430997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IN-AIR CONTROLS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the in-air controls to flip and roll your car through the air! Master the mechanics and perfect your landings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638250/extras/1cdcf87abdbaba5f9526e4aed8f8b1fe.poster.avif?t=1783430997\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638250/extras/1cdcf87abdbaba5f9526e4aed8f8b1fe.webm?t=1783430997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638250/extras/1cdcf87abdbaba5f9526e4aed8f8b1fe.mp4?t=1783430997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete races &amp; challenges and use credits to unlock new parts, paint your car &amp; more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638250/extras/f73f5e293c53442636b3f0f835a9cd5c.poster.avif?t=1783430997\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638250/extras/f73f5e293c53442636b3f0f835a9cd5c.webm?t=1783430997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638250/extras/f73f5e293c53442636b3f0f835a9cd5c.mp4?t=1783430997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE &amp; SHARE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own tracks using the Track Builder, share or download other player-made tracks using the Steam Workshop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638250/extras/5d4827d09eb94ec07269c39db8766617.poster.avif?t=1783430997\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638250/extras/5d4827d09eb94ec07269c39db8766617.webm?t=1783430997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638250/extras/5d4827d09eb94ec07269c39db8766617.mp4?t=1783430997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ROADMAP FOR 2026</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Below is the roadmap of content coming in 2026! The content and features will be split into Major &amp; Minor updates during their planned release periods.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638250/extras/6bc98ec65657f8cc2e0bfe4836f80d14.avif?t=1783430997\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638250/extras_big/6bc98ec65657f8cc2e0bfe4836f80d14.webp?t=1783430997 width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4690K / AMD Ryzen5 1500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 970 / AMD Radeon RX 480<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Casual","Indie","Racing","Simulation","Early Access"],"developers":["Thunderboom Studios"],"publishers":["Thunderboom Studios"],"release_date":"19 Feb, 2026"}